cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this early-development snapshot of Trainer Studio, please cite it with these metadata. Version 0.6.4.3 is a pre-1.0 preview."
title: "Trainer Studio"
abstract: >-
  Trainer Studio is an open-source, local-first tool for labeling YOLO
  object-detection datasets. Bounding boxes, polygons, oriented boxes, and
  pose are edited in a browser UI served by a FastAPI process on the same
  computer. Status: early development. Version 0.6.4.3 is a pre-1.0 preview
  and may change. The open core is licensed under AGPL-3.0.
authors:
  - alias: ondery
version: 0.6.4.3
date-released: 2026-10-24
license: AGPL-3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ondery/TrainerStudio"
url: "https://github.com/ondery/TrainerStudio"
type: software
keywords:
  - YOLO
  - image annotation
  - object detection
  - bounding box
  - polygon
  - dataset labeling
